WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:02.877
Right, what do you need
to know?

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:03.920
This is my boyfriend,

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.004
Jason.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.047
He's great.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:08.133
I mean his hair's
better longer but-

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.593
I'll go shirts. If that's-
Is that right?

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:13.888
So turns out we can't
have kids the fun way.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:15.598
Which is, you know
it's absolutely,

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:17.600
completely,
totally, fine?

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:18.893
So what do we
do now?

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.770
A small piece
of us dies and

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.231
we just carry on
with whatever is left

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:24.315
Alright.

00:00:24.315 --> 00:00:25.442
Well as long as we've
got a plan.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.777
But we have a plan.

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:29.279
We're going to adopt
our own family.

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:30.905
And I thought right.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:31.906
If we're going
to do this

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:33.908
we need to become
more you know,

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:34.868
grown up.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.369
Start using bay leaves
in cooking

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.412
even though they
don't taste of anything

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.413
and everyone
knows it.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:39.873
You're talking like an
American again

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.249
you know I hate it
when you do that.

00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:42.667
But then sort
of realized

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.669
you never really
feel grown up

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:47.046
or ready enough for
the big stuff do you?

00:00:47.046 --> 00:00:49.716
You just have to
sort of, do it anyway?

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.092
Or you run
out of time.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:52.051
So that's what
we're doing.

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:53.553
We're doing it anyway.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.013
Let's see what
happens, shall we?

